WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.148 --> 00:00:03.310
THE HIGH EVOLUTIONARY
The Guardians of the Galaxy...

00:00:04.086 --> 00:00:06.612
...have no place in my world.

00:00:07.781 --> 00:00:09.390
ROCKET
Kiss your mom with that face?

00:00:09.441 --> 00:00:10.109
NEBULA
Oh no.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:11.763
[Screaming]

00:00:12.195 --> 00:00:13.369
GAMORA
Some corners of the universe

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.729
consider him God.

00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:17.334
PETER QUILL
It's a face off.

00:00:17.391 --> 00:00:18.273
DRAX
Yeah!

00:00:20.305 --> 00:00:21.545
PETER QUILL
Then I guess we'll die trying.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:24.661
ROCKET
I decided "die trying"

00:00:24.711 --> 00:00:25.448
ain't our thing no more.

00:00:25.498 --> 00:00:26.077
DRAX
Ha!

